<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">WAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc2">WAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAGALATIA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabu cha Wagalatia chandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto yakemigwe Paulo (1:1). Lukala lupwilili Paulo luyandike ha wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali Galatia hagatigati ya kipigiti cha milao ya 48 na 57 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto. Siku Wagalatia wakala wanhu wokala mdiwambo da Loma muisi ya Galatia. Wasomi hawavitanga goya kamba Paulo kakala kwahi kipigiti viyandike lupwilili luno. Ila vodahika kamba kakala mmiwambo ino mibili, mdiwambo da Efeso ama mdiwambo da Kolinto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo kawandikila wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto, Wayahudi na wanhu wakalile sio Wayahudi, wali mmadale ga wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ako Galatia. Kandika sama ya kuigombela na mafundizo ga uvwizi gaja galongile kamba wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wolondigwa kugawinza malagizo ga Wayahudi kulawa Mdilagano da Umwaka, ng'haning'hani kwingila kumbi. Kukala na dale da wanhu mmwanza wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto dikemigwe Wanhu Wowatenda Wanhu Wayagwe Kuwa Wayahudi, wawalondile wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakalile sio Wayahudi wengizigwe kumbi. Vivija waulema udaho wa kitumigwa wa Paulo. Paulo kaugombela udaho wake wa kitumigwa mkusimulila mbuli zake (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:14">1:11—2:14</ref></char>) na kaugombela Usenga Unogile mkusimulila kamba ukombola wokwiza kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto (2:16). Gano gago malawililo ga unovu ulaguswa na Mulungu na sio gaja gowotenda wanhu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kosonga lupwilili lwake mkuwalamsa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ako Galatia (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho Paulo kolongelela mbuli zake mwenyego zibitile mkuigombela sang'hano yake ya kufundiza na kulagusa kamba kakala yagezile kukala ukazi wa kugatamanila Malagizo ga Musa, ila ukazi huo umulemelwa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-2:12">1:6—2:12</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kasimulila nafasi ya Malagizo ga Musa na nafasi ya ngekewa muukombola (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3-4">3—4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho kolava ndagizi ha munhu yamtogole Kilisto avija vondayakale ukazi unogile (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Paulo komambukiza lupwilili lwake na ndamsa na nhambiko za kimambukizo mkukumbukila kamba kugalulwa na Mulungu na kuwa munhu wa sambi kicho kinhu kinogile ng'hani kubanza mbuli za lukuli, kamba vija kwingizigwa kumbi (<char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1-2"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mtumigwa wa Kilisto, hamoja na wandugu wose wali na nie. Nie sisaguligwe na wanhu ama na udaho wa munhu yoyose, ila nisaguligwa na Yesu Kilisto hamoja na Mulungu Tata, yamzusile Yesu kulawa mkudanganhika. Towalamsa mweye wanhu wamtogole Kilisto muli muisi ya Galatia.<verse eid="GAL 1:1-2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Yesu kailava mwenyego giladi yatukombole kulawa m'vilozo vetu kulawa muulumwengu uno wihile utukala, kamba vija Mulungu na Tata wetu viyalondile. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Yenzi iwe ha Mulungu milongo yose! Amina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Usenga Umwe Unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Nie nikanganya ng'hani, avija mkipigiti kiguhi vummulekile Mulungu, ayo yawakemile mweye kubitila ngekewa ya Kilisto na kugalukila kuusenga uyagwe, awo ukiitenda kamba Usenga Unogile, <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>awo kabisa si Usenga Unogile. Mgeligwa ubozi na awo wolonda kuuhindula Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Ila hata kamba tweye ama msenga wa Mulungu kulawa kuulanga yahawapetela Usenga uyagwe Unogile mbali na uno utuupeta tweye, nayadukumizigwe. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Kamba vutwishile kulonga, na sambi nolonga kabili, kamba munhu yoyose yahawapetela Usenga Unogile mbali na uja umuubokele, munhu hiyo yadukumizigwe.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Mkulonga vino nolonda wanhu wanhogole ama Mulungu yanhogole? Ama nolonda kuwanogeza wanhu? Kamba nihalondile kuwanogeza wanhu, sambiniwe mtumigwa wa Kilisto.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Viyapatile Utumigwa wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda m'vitange, Usenga Unogile uniupetile sio kinhu kitendigwe na munhu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Siubokele kulawa ha munhu yoyose, ama kufundizigwa, ila niubokela kubitila lugubulo kulawa ha Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Mweye muhulika mbuli zangu kipigiti cha umwaka vinikalile mnhamanila ya Kiyahudi, avija vinikalile niwagaza ng'hani wanhu wa Mulungu wamtogole Kilisto bila kuwonela bazi na kugeza kuwabananga. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Nie nikala Muyahudi niigogile nhamanila yangu ng'hani kuwabanza Wayahudi bwando wa mkamo wangu, na nikala nikiiyohile ng'hani kuzigoga nzoela za wahenga zetu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Ila Mulungu kanisagula nie songela sinavumbuka na kung'hema nie kubitila ngekewa yake. Na viyalamule <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>kumgubula mwanage kumwangu, giladi nimpete heyo mwa Wamhazi, silondile masala kulawa ha munhu yoyose, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>ama kuchola Yelusalemu kuiting'hana na awo wanilongole kuwa watumigwa wa Kilisto. Ila hima nichola muisi ya Alabia, na abaho nibwela mdiwambo da Damaski. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Abaho, milao midatu ibitile, nyhola Yelusalemu kumtembelela Petulo, na nikala na heyo mazua longo dimwe na matano. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ila simonile mtumigwa yoyose iyagwe wa Kilisto ila Yakobo, mdodo wake Mndewa.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Nowalongela ikweli haulongozi wa Mulungu kamba gano ganiwandikila sio uvwizi.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Abaho, nichola kuna ziisi za Silia na Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Kipigiti hicho wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali muisi ya Yudea wakala hawananimanya mkunyona mkihanga. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Ila wahulika wanhu wayagwe wolonga kamba, “Munhu ija yakalile yotugaza, sambi koipeta nhamanila iyakalile yolonda kuibananga.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Na wamuyenzi Mulungu sama yangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Watumigwa Wayagwe wa Kilisto Woitogola Sang'hano ya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Viibitile milao longo dimwe na mine nibweleganya kabili Yelusalemu, kipigiti kino nikala hamoja na Banaba, vivija tumsola na Tito. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Nichola kuja kwavija Mulungu kanigubulila kamba nolondigwa nichole. Abaho niwagwelela Usenga Unogile waubitile, Usenga uja unikalile niupeta mwa Wamhazi. Ila nigatenda gano kubitila mting'hano wa kifiso na vilangizi, kwavija nikala nidumba kamba kija kinitendile ama kija kinigendelela kutenda sambikipotele na mkimbilo wangu uwe jaga bule. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Hata Tito yakalile Mgiliki, yakalile hamoja na nie, hashulutizwe kwingizigwa kumbi, <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>hata avo wanhu wayagwe walonda wamwingize kumbi. Kwavija wanhu wavwizile kumtogola Kilisto wakiingiza kinyemela hatukalile kuusepa ulegeho utulinao mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto giladi watutende kuwa nyakadala zao. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Ila hatuwatogole hata kidogo, giladi ikweli ya Usenga Unogile usigale mgati yenu mazua gose.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Ila waja woneke kuwa vilangizi, hawanyongezele mbuli yoyose. Hawanitendele kinhu chochose kiyagwe, kwavija Mulungu hatagusa mkulola kiwiliwili cha hanze. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Ila wona kamba nigweleligwa sang'hano ya kuupeta Usenga Unogile ha Wamhazi, kamba vija Petulo viyagweleligwe sang'hano ya kuupeta Usenga uno ha Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Kwavija Mulungu yakalile yosang'hanika msang'hano ya Petulo kamba mtumigwa wa Kilisto mwa Wayahudi, vivija kakala yosang'hanika msang'hano yangu kamba mtumigwa wa Kilisto mwa Wamhazi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Yakobo, Petulo, na Yohana, awo woneke kuwa vilangizi, viwaitangile nhunza inigweleligwe, watugwelela mkono wa ukulume nie na Banaba kulagusa kamba twa hamoja. Watogola kamba tweye tuchole ha Wamhazi na hewo wachole ha Wayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Watulonda tutende kinhu kimwe, sambituwasemwe wakumbulu mdidale jao, kinhu kinikalile nigesa kukitenda.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Komkomhokela Petulo ako Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Ila Petulo viyezile mdiwambo da Antiokia, nim'bamilila kihanga kwa kihanga kwavija kakala yotenda gehile ng'hani. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Kipigiti wanhu watumigwe na Yakobo hawanavika, kakala yoja na Wamhazi wamtogole Kilisto. Ila viwavikile, kasonga kuibweza kuchugu na kuibagula kulawa ha Wamhazi kwavija kakala yowadumba awo wakalile mdidale da awo wawashulutize Wamhazi wengizigwe kumbi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Na Wayahudi wayagwe wamtogole Kilisto wailumba na udelenya wa Petulo, avo sama ya udelenya wao wamwagiza hata Banaba. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Vinyonile kamba hawakalile wotenda galingile na ikweli ya Usenga Unogile, nimulongela Petulo haulongozi wa hewo wose, “Gweye kwa Muyahudi, ila kokala kamba Mmhazi na sio kamba Muyahudi. Vilihi kabili kowashulutiza Wamhazi wazigoge nzoela za Wayahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayahudi na Wamhazi Wokomboligwa na Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Tweye twa Wayahudi wa kuvumbuka na sio “Wamhazi wali na vilozo,” kamba viwokemigwa na Wayahudi wayagwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Tweye tuvitanga kamba munhu hapetigwa kuwa mwende wa Mulungu mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, ila muinhamanila mgati ya Yesu Kilisto. Avo na tweye vivija twika nhamanila yetu mgati ya Yesu Kilisto giladi tutendigwe kuwa wende kubitila nhamanila mgati ya Kilisto, na sio mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, kwavija mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa haduhu yondayapetigwe kuwa mwende wa Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Kamba vija vituzahila kuwa wende wa Mulungu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, yowa usindila kamba tweye wenyego tokoneka kuwa wene vilozo kamba viwali Wamhazi, avo tulonge kamba Kilisto kowatenda wanhu watende vilozo? Si vivo kabisa! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Kamba nihakizenga kabili kija kinibomole, noilagusa kamba nie kweli notenda gehile. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Kwavija kubitila Malagizo ga Musa nidanganhika sama ya Malagizo higo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kudanganhika sama ya Malagizo higo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kuleka kulongozigwa na Malagizo ga Musa.</char></note> giladi niwe na ugima sama ya Mulungu. Nidanganhika hamoja na Kilisto mumsalaba wake, <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>na sio nie nili na ugima, ila Kilisto iyo yongwelela ugima mgati yangu. Ukazi unikala mulukuli luno, nokala mnhamanila ya kumtogola Mwana wa Mulungu, ayo yaninogele nie na kuilava heyo mwenyego sama yangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Nie siilema ngekewa ya Mulungu, kwavija kamba kuwa bule uzenzeleganye kuyalinao Mulungu kwiza kubitila Malagizo ga Musa, basi Kilisto kadanganhika bule!<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Malagizo ga Musa ama Nhamanila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Mweye Wagalatia wabozi! Yalihi yawalogile? Kwavija nie niwapetela goya vija Yesu Kilisto viyadanganhike mumsalaba. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Nolonda munilongele kinhu kimwe, m'bokela Loho wa Mulungu mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa ama mkuuhulika Usenga Unogile na kuutogola? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Mweye mwa wabozi kamba vino? Msonga kukala ukazi wa kuilumba na Loho wa Mulungu, habali sambi molonda kukala ukazi wa kutamanila nzonzi zenu? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Vino kugaya kumgayile sama ya Usenga Unogile, mgaya bule? Kamba mbuli zenyego vivo zili, kweli mgaya bule. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Mulungu kowagwelela mweye Loho wake na kutenda mizonza mmwenu kwavija mgagoga Malagizo ga Musa ama kwavija muutogola Usenga Unogile wa Yesu Kilisto?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Tumgelegeze Ablaham, kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga, “Ablaham kamtogola Mulungu, avo kapetigwa kamba munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">MWANDUSO 15:6</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Avo m'vimanye kamba awo womtogola Mulungu wawo lukolo lwa Ablaham. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Nyandiko Zing'alile zilola kuulongozi na kona kamba Mulungu kowatenda Wamhazi kuwa wende sama ya nhamanila yao. Mulungu kaulonga Usenga uno Unogile ha Ablaham, yolonga, “Wamhazi wose womotezwa kubitila gweye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">MWANDUSO 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:18">18:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:18">22:18</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Sama ya kilamso kino, awo wekile nhamanila yao mwa Kilisto womotezwa, kamba vija Ablaham viyamotezwe sama ya nhamanila yake.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Kwavija waja wose wogendelela kugatamanila Malagizo ga Musa kuwatenda watogoligwe na Mulungu wa muna indukumiza, kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Munhu yoyose yalekile kuzigoga na kuziwinza mbuli zose zandikigwe mkitabu cha Malagizo ga Musa kodukumizwa na Mulungu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 27:26">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 27:26</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Kweli kabisa, haduhu munhu yondayapetigwe kuwa kabule uzenzeleganye haulongozi wa Mulungu mkugagoga Malagizo ga Musa, kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Munhu yalibule uzenzeleganye kokala mnhamanila.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">HABAKUKI 2:4</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Na Malagizo ga Musa hagatamanila nhamanila. Ila Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Munhu yoyose yogatenda gose gali Mmalagizo ga Musa kowa na ugima kubitila Malagizo higo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">MBULI ZA WALAWI 18:5</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kilisto katukombola kulawa muna inhaguso ya Gamalagizo ga Musa. Kipigiti viyatumbikwe mumsalaba, kadukumizwa sama ya mbuli zetu zihile, kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Munhu yoyose yatumbikwe mum'biki kadukumizigwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 21:23</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Yesu Kilisto katukombola tweye giladi motelo zija Mulungu zayailagane na Ablaham, Mulungu yawagwelele Wamhazi kubitila Yesu Kilisto, giladi mkubitila nhamanila tubokele Loho wa Mulungu, ayo Mulungu yalongile kamba komgala.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Malagizo ga Musa na Kilagano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Ndugu zangu, beta niwalongele mbuli zilingile na gaja gatutendaga mazua gose. Wanhu wabili wahaitogolela mbuli, haduhu munhu yondayagabene gaja gawaitogolele ama kongeza kinhu muimbuli ija. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Mulungu kamwikila kilagano Ablaham na lukolo lwake, Nyandiko Zing'alile hazilonga, “Na ng'holo zake,” kamba wanhu bwando, ila zolonga, “Na lukolo lwake,” nhegulo yake munhu imwe, na munhu hiyo iyo Kilisto.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 12:7">NG'HUMBUKILA YA TOLATI 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:7">24:7</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Kinilonda kulonga icho kino, Malagizo ga Musa, gezile milao mia nne na malongo madatu hamwande, hagadaha kudibenhusa hamgwazo lagano dikigwe haichanduso na Mulungu na kusegeza kilagano cha Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Kwavija kamba nhunza ya Mulungu yotamanila Gamalagizo ga Musa, basi havidahika kutamanila kilagano. Ila Mulungu muunovu wake kamgwaa Ablaham nhunza kubitila kilagano.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Avo Malagizo ga Musa gakala na sang'hano ilihi? Malagizo ga Musa gongezigwa mdilagano giladi kulagusa nhegulo ya vilozo, na ikala isang'hanika mbaka kipigiti viyezile Kilisto, ayo wa lukolo lwa Ablaham, Mulungu yekile kilagano sama yake. Mulungu kagalava Malagizo ha Musa kubitila wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, ayo yakalile hagatigati ya Mulungu na wanhu. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Munhu wa hagatigati mazua gose kosang'hanika na wanhu wa mmadale mabili. Ila Mulungu, ayo yali yeiyeka, hakalile na munhu wa hagatigati kipigiti viyamgwelele Ablaham kilagano chake.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilondigwa na Malagizo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Avo tulonge Malagizo ga Musa gokiibamilila na vilagano va Mulungu? Si vivo kabisa! Kwavija kamba Malagizo gawabokele wanhu gahadahile kuwatenda wapate ugima, wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye wahapatikane mkugagoga Malagizo higo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ila Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga kamba, wanhu wose wa mkifungo cha mhiko za vilozo, giladi nhunza ija itulongeligwe kamba togweleligwa kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto wogweleligwa awo wondawatogole.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Kipigiti nhamanila ino hainakwiza, tukala wafungigwa wa Malagizo ga Musa, tufungigwa mbaka haja nhamanila ija vuigubuligwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Avo Malagizo ga Musa gakala na udaho wa kutulongoza mbaka viyezile Kilisto, giladi tupetigwe kamba wende wa Mulungu kubitila nhamanila. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Avo sambi nhamanila iza, Malagizo ga Musa gabule udaho wa kutulongoza.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Avo mweye mose mwa wana wa Mulungu kubitila nhamanila mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Kwavija mweye mose m'batizigwe mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, mowa kamba Kilisto mwenyego. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Haduhu Muyahudi ama Mgiliki, nyakadala ama yailegehe, mbigalo ama mtwanzi, kwavija mweye mose mwa kinhu kimwe mkuilumba na Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Kamba mweye mwa wanhu wa Kilisto, avo mweye mwa lukolo lwa Ablaham. Mweye mwa wahazi wake, na kilagano cha Mulungu chayailagane na Ablaham chowa chenu.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Kinilonda kulonga icho kino, muhazi kipigiti yali mdodo, kalinga kamba nyakadala, hata kamba heyo iyo mwene vinhu vose. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Heyo ka hasi ya wemilizi na walezi mbaka kipigiti kikigwe na tataake. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Avo vivija na tweye, vitukalile wadodo twingizigwa muunyakadala hasi ya ulongozi wa loho yotawala ulumwengu uno. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Ila kipigiti kilondigwe vikivikile, Mulungu kamtuma Mwanage muulumwengu. Kaleligwa na mtwanzi, kakala hasi ya Malagizo ga Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>giladi yatukombole tweye tose tukalile hasi ya Malagizo ga Musa, giladi tutendigwe kuwa wana wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Na kwavija mweye mwa wana zake, Mulungu kamgala Loho wa Mwanage mmioyo yetu, yotutenda tweye tulile, “Aba!” Nhegulo yake “Tata!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Avo mweye hamuli nyakadala wa loho ija yotawala ulumwengu uno, ila mwa wana, na kwavija mweye mwa wana wa Mulungu, Mulungu kawatenda mweye vivija muwe wahazi.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Kodungwadungwa Sama ya Wagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Umwaka kipigiti vumkalile hamunamtanga Mulungu, mkala nyakadala wa vinhu vikalile si miungu. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Ila sambi mumtanga Mulungu, ama mmbuli ziyagwe Mulungu kowatanga mweye, modahaze kubweleganya kabili kuna ziloho zinyekile zilibule kinhu? Habali molonda kuwa nyakadala zao mwanza wa ikabili? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Mng'hali mogoga mazua kisinyo, milenge, misimu, na milao. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Nodumba kamba sang'hano iniisang'hane sama yenu iwa bule.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Ndugu zangu, nowayalalila mweye mkale kamba nie vinikala muulegeho kulawa mzimbuli zino, kwavija nie nigaluka kamba mweye Wamhazi, muulegeho kulawa Mmalagizo gose ga Musa. Mweye hamunitendele mbuli yoyose ihile kipigiti vinikalile waichanduso kuwapetela mweye Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>M'vitanga kamba sama ya utamu niwapetela mweye Usenga Unogile mwanza wa ichanduso. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Hata kamba utamu wangu ukala mbuli ngaga kumwenu, ila mweye hamunizabuze ama kunilema, ila munibokela kamba vija nikala msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, kamba vija nikala Yesu Kilisto mwenyego. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Mkala na ndeng'ha! Avo choni kiwalawilile? Nolonda nilonge kamba, kamba muhadaha mgalave meso genu mngwelele nie. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Sambi nie nigaluka mdumuka wenu sama ya kuwalongela mweye ikweli?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Wanhu waja wolonda kuuhindula Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto, wosulukila ng'hani wawapate mweye, ila si kwa mbuli zinogile. Kinhu chowolonda kuwatenda mweye mwinege na nie, giladi muwe na sulukila iija mgati yao kamba hewo viwali nayo mgati yenu. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Vinoga kuwa na sulukila ya kutenda ganogile mkipigiti chose, na sio tu mkipigiti nie nihawa hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Wanangu wanogelwa! Mwanza uyagwe nokona usungu wa kulela mwana sama yenu, mbaka mgaluke kuwa wanahina wa kweli wa Kilisto. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Nolonda ng'hani kukala na mweye sambisambi, na nogalula dizwi jangu, kwavija nodungwadungwa ng'hani sama yenu.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sala na Hajili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Nilongeleni, mweye mulonda kukala hasi ya Malagizo ga Musa, hamgahulika Gamalagizo ga Musa vugalonga? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile kamba Ablaham kakala na wana wabili, mwana imwe kaleligwa na mtwanzi yakalile nyakadala, na mwana iyagwe kaleligwa na mtwanzi yailegehe. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Mwana yavumbuke na mtwanzi nyakadala kavumbuka kamba viwovumbuka wana wayagwe, ila mwana yavumbuke na mtwanzi yailegehe kavumbuka sama ya kuvikiza kilagano cha Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Watwanzi wano wabili wawa kamba kilingilo cha malagano mabili. Lagano dimwe dolawa Kudigongo da Sinai, dino dijo lagano da Hajili, na dolela wana wondawawe nyakadala. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Avo Hajili kalinga na Gongo da Sinai dili muisi ya Alabia, na kalinga na wambo da Yelusalemu ya lelo, kwavija ka muunyakadala hamoja na wanage. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Ila Sala kalinga na Yelusalemu ili kuulanga, iilegeha, na heyo kalinga na mamaetu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Deng'helela gweye mtwanzi ulibule sambo, gweye hulelile mwana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Toa nyangi na ulile ng'hani mkudeng'ha gweye hulanzile usungu wa kulela mwana!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Kwavija mtwanzi mgane kowa na wana bwando</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">kum'banza ija yali na mbigalo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">ISAYA 54:1</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, mweye mwa wana wa Mulungu sama ya kilagano chake kamba viyakalile Isaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Ila kamba viikalile kipigiti kija, mwana yavumbuke kamba viwovumbuka wana wayagwe kamgaza mwana yavumbuke kamba Loho wa Mulungu viyalondile, avo na kipigiti kino vivo ili. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Ila Nyandiko Zing'alile zolongaze? Zolonga, “Muwinge mtwanzi nyakadala na mwanage, kwavija mwana wa mtwanzi nyakadala havidahika kuhala hamoja na mwana wa mtwanzi yailegehe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">MWANDUSO 21:10</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, tweye hatuli wana wa mtwanzi yali nyakadala, ila twa wana wa mtwanzi yailegehe.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Mwike Goya Ulegeho Wenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kilisto katukombola, avo kaleni muilegehe, sambimuigele wenyego kabili mkifungo cha unyakadala wa Malagizo ga Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Tegelezeni! Nie, Paulo, nowalongela kamba muhatogola kwingizigwa kumbi, Kilisto kowa si kinhu kabisa kumwenu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Nolonga kabili ha kila munhu yotogola kwingila kumbi kamba kolondigwa yagagoge Malagizo gose ga Musa. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Mweye mulondile kuwa wende wa Mulungu mkubitila kugagoga Malagizo ga Musa muisegeza wenyego kulawa ha Kilisto, muihonya ngekewa ya Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Kumwetu tweye, tamanilo jetu kamba Mulungu kotupeta kamba twabule uzenzeleganye hamoja na heyo. Vino vivo tubeta na mhiko ya Loho wa Mulungu yosang'hanika kubitila nhamanila yetu. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Kwavija tuhailumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto, kwingila kumbi ama kuleka kwingila kumbi si kinhu kipetigwa, ila kinhu kipetigwa nhamanila iwatenda mweye muwanogele wanhu wayagwe.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Mkala mgendelela goya mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, avo yalihi yawagomese muleke kuigoga kweli ino? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Uswagizi uno haulawile ha Mulungu, ayo yawakemile mweye. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Fundizo dino da uvwizi dilinga kamba mela dodo ditenda tonge jose dilulumuke. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Nie sidungwadungwa mmoyo sama yenu mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa kamba hamgelegeza mbali na vunigelegeza nie. Ila munhu yoyose yowatenda mweye muwegele kotagusigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Ila, ndugu zangu, habali nie ning'hali nigaya kamba ning'hali nipeta kamba wanhu wolondigwa wengile kumbi? Kamba ihawa vino basi ving'hwaso vilawilile sama ya usenga wangu wa mbuli ya msalaba wa Kilisto vihasegezwe. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Nolonda kamba waja wowagudemeza, awo wolonda kuwabananga mweye mkuwengiza kumbi, waibanange wenyego.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Mweye, ndugu zangu, mkemigwa giladi mkale muulegeho, ila sambimuugalule ulegeho uno kamba uwo nafasi ya kutenda gaja golusulukila lukuli, ila noge diwatende mweye muisang'hanikile wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Kwavija Malagizo gose ga Musa gavikizwa muindagizi imwe, ilonga, “Mnogele munhu wa mmabehi nagwe kamba vuukinogela gweye.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ila kamba muhaigagadula na kuija kamba wang'onyo wa kumuhulo, loleni sambimuibanange wenyego kwa wenyego.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuli Zoyolonda Loho na Mbuli Zilulonda Lukuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Avo nolonga, kaleni mkulongozigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, mkutenda hivo hamdaha kuziwinza sulukila za lukuli. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Kwavija gaja gosulukilwa na lukuli goibamilila na gaja golondigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, na gaja gosulukilwa na Loho wa Mulungu goibamilila na gaja golondigwa na lukuli. Gano mabili goibamilila, giladi gawazuile kutenda gaja gamulonda. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ila kamba muhalongozwa na Loho wa Mulungu, hamuli hasi ya Malagizo ga Musa.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Sang'hano za lukuli zizo zino, ugoni, unyolodosi, uvuludusi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>kutambikila miwegu, uhawi, kuihila, uhasanyi, migongo, lusango, ndwagi, kuuigola, kuibeza, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>wivu, kukoligwa, kutenda sona za kuja na kung'wa ugimbi chaka, na vinhu vilingile kamba hivo. Nowalongela kamba viniwalongele haichanduso, kamba, awo wotenda mbuli kamba zino havidahika kuuhala Undewa wa Mulungu.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Ila zino zizo mbuli zilawa Muloho wa Mulungu, noge, deng'ho, tindiwalo, mwazaganyo, moyo kunoga, unozi, kuwa bule uzenzeleganye, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>uhozi, na kuizuila kutenda mbuli zihile. Haduhu malagizo mzimbuli kamba zino. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Na awo wali wanhu wa Yesu Kilisto waluwamba lukuli mumsalaba hamoja na sulukila na ngelegeza zake zihile. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Tuhakala mkumtamanila Loho wa Mulungu, vivija tutogole kulongozwa na Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Avo sambituitope ama kuidwanza wenyego kwa wenyego ama kuiyonela migongo.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ipapileni Mibahasha Wenyego kwa Wenyego</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ndugu zangu, kamba munhu mmwanza wenu koneka yotenda vilozo, mweye mose mtenda gaja goyolonga Loho wa Mulungu, molondigwa mum'bweze munhu hiyo mholemhole mnzila igoloke. Ila teganyeni na mweye vivija sambimgezigwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Ipapileni mibahasha wenyego kwa wenyego, mkutenda vino mogavikiza malagizo ga Kilisto. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Kamba munhu yahakiiyona kinhu, kumbe heyo si kinhu, koivwizila mwenyego. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Kila munhu na yailole sang'hano yake mwenyego, kamba inoga basi na yaitopele sang'hano ija iyatendile bila kuilinga na sang'hano ya munhu iyagwe, <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>kwavija kila munhu kolondigwa kudipapa bahasha jake mwenyego.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Awo wobokela mafundo ga Usenga wa Mulungu wolondigwa wasangile vinhu vose vinogile ha wakulufunzi zao.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Sambimuivwizile, Mulungu haponezwaga, kwavija chochose chondauhande kicho chondauhune. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Uhahanda mulukuli, kohuna ubananzi kulawa mulukuli. Ila kamba uhahanda muloho, kohuna ugima wa digunge kulawa muloho. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Avo sambitudonhe kutenda ganogile, kwavija tokwiza kuhuna mumsimu wake kamba hatubwelile kukisogo. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Avo tuhapata nafasi, tuwatendele ganogile wanhu wose, ng'haning'hani awo wali mmulango wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndagizi na Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Loleni vinyandika na helufi ng'hulu na mkono wangu mwenyego! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Wanhu wowashulutiza mweye mwingile kumbi iwo waja wolonda woneke wanoga mmbuli za mulukuli. Na wotenda vino sama ya kinhu kimwe, kamba sambiwagaye sama ya ifa ya Kilisto mumsalaba. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Hata waja wengile kumbi hawagagoga Malagizo ga Musa, ila wolonda mweye mwingile kumbi giladi waitopele kwingila kumbi kumwenu. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Nie nabule kinhu chochose cha kuitopela, ila msalaba uyawambigwe Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. Kubitila msalaba uno, niupeta ulumwengu kamba vija wisha kudanganhika, na mmbuli ya ulumwengu, nie nipetigwa kamba vija nidanganhika. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Kwingila kumbi ama kuleka kwingila kumbi si kinhu kipetigwa, ila kinhu kipetigwa kuwa munhu wa sambi. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Tindiwalo na bazi vikale na awo wose wodiwinza lagizo dino, na Islaeli ya Mulungu, nhegulo yake “wanhu wa Mulungu.”<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Kusongela sambi na kugendelela, munhu sambiyangaze, kwavija nizipapa ng'hovu za Yesu mulukuli lwangu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ndugu zangu, ngekewa ya Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto iwe na loho zenu. Amina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
